\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .  God is so Great!
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0 This is the song of all creatures on earth,
\par in great honour, we give Him praise
\par So Let us sing together
\par God is so Great!
\par God is so Great!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  God is so Great!
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0 and through His wisdom, He gave a test to us,
\par with those on High, so unexplained
\par In all His wisdom, power;
\par God is so full of all kindness.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.    God is so Great!
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0  This calling comes to us every morn till eve
\par  That He is love, so free and kind
\par  And through the Father's blessings,
\par  He takes great care of all His works.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.    And with this faith.
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0   that they may all become one in all His praise;
\par  and through thy songs in all the world:
\par  So, let all nations praise Him
\par  God is so Great!
\par  God is so Great!
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

